{"2465730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Once Upon A Tile", "steam_appid": 2465730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/0ee88ecb3888024364a1b4558fce0ca0.avif?t=1743071191\" width=558 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/0ee88ecb3888024364a1b4558fce0ca0.avif?t=1743071191\" width=558 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>", "short_description": "Once Upon A Tile is a rogue-lite strategic dungeon-builder, where you don't control the hero! Instead, you cleverly place dungeon tiles to guide your hero to victory - or to their demise, if you are careless. You will need to be tricky and clever in this dungeon-building puzzle game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/header.jpg?t=1743071191", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/f8609275b14dee23838ac17b70f5c4497dea93ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743071191", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/f8609275b14dee23838ac17b70f5c4497dea93ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743071191", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5 7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> </li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["KnotHorn Studio"], "publishers": ["KnotHorn Studio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1799, "final": 1799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$17.99"}, "packages": [887494], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Once Upon A Tile", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "displa